       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. IDXFILE.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT IDX-FILE ASSIGN TO IDX-FILE
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS WS-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD IDX-FILE.
       01 IDX-RECORD PIC X(80).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-KEY PIC X(10).
       01 WS-STATUS PIC XX.
       01 WS-EOF PIC X VALUE 'N'.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           OPEN INPUT IDX-FILE.
           MOVE 'KEY0000001' TO WS-KEY.
           READ IDX-FILE
               INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'NOT FOUND ' WS-STATUS
               NOT INVALID KEY DISPLAY IDX-RECORD
           END-READ.
           CLOSE IDX-FILE.
           STOP RUN.
